      "source": "A <a href=\"TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext</code></a> with less restrictive field reference handling, suppressing\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/InvalidPersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>InvalidPersistentPropertyPath</code></a> exceptions when resolving mapped field names.",
      "translation": "一个 <a href=\"TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>TypeBasedAggregationOperationContext</code></a>，其字段引用处理机制更为宽松，在解析映射字段名称时会抑制 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/InvalidPersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>InvalidPersistentPropertyPath</code></a> 异常。",
      "count": 1
